# NOTE: app/static (the prebuilt React bundle) and dist/*.zip (the shippable archive)
# are deliberately COMMITTED. Meridian is distributed as a runnable artifact: Node is a
# build-time dependency only, so downloading this repository must yield a working
# app. See docs/DECISIONS.md D-023.
# The folder the zip is staged from is not committed: it is the same bytes a second
# time, and it now holds the prepared demo database and 153 statement files.
